<mxCell id="u721" value="end to end" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;align=center;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="248" width="100" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="u722" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; (A) unit: the function alone is wrong. (B) integration: the writer stores the wrong number. (C) end to end: the data is right and the person never sees it." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="312" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
