<mxCell id="u1030" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; Fee within 0–1500, and member ≤ guest. Without the cap, a guest at hour 16 pays 1600. For a clip function, name idempotence." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="362" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
